device  first appeared in WIDE/KAME IPv6 stack.  No more than one
interface is allowed for a node, and no more than one IPv6 inter‐
face address is allowed for an interface.  It is to avoid  source
address  selection  conflicts  between IPv6 layer and IPv4 layer,
and to cope with ingress filtering rule on the other side.   This
is a feature to make work right for all occasions.
